[00:00.00] 作词 : Mike Shinoda
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Mike Shinoda
[00:02.00] 制作人 : Bradford Philip Delson/Michael "Mike" Shinoda
[00:27.65] Should've stayed, were there signs, I ignored? (本该留下的，是否是我忽视的那些预兆？)
[00:39.14] Can I help you, not to hurt, anymore? (我能否帮你，不再受到伤害？)
[00:50.54] We saw brilliance, when the world, was asleep (世界沉睡之际，我们看到了灿烂星河)
[01:01.94] There are things that we can have, but can't keep (有些东西，虽能拥有，却无法长留)
[01:10.20]
[01:10.52] If they say (若他们说)
[01:12.63] Who cares if one more light goes out? (谁会在意，即使光芒重现后再熄灭掉)
[01:16.18] In the sky of a million stars (在那万千星河之中)
[01:21.24] It flickers, flickers (闪烁着点点星光，忽隐忽现)
[01:24.90] Who cares when someone's time runs out? (谁又会在意，当某人的时间飞驰，流逝)
[01:27.68] If a moment is all we are (我们都仅是一瞬间)
[01:32.63] Or quicker, quicker (或者，再快些)
[01:35.54] Who cares if one more light goes out? (谁还会在意又一道光熄灭掉)
[01:39.41] Well I do (然而，我会)
[01:43.62]
[01:46.97] The reminders, pull the floor from your feet (那些便笺，压倒了你)
[01:58.46] In the kitchen, one more chair than you need, oh (在厨房里，空出了一张原本属于你的椅子)
[02:09.88] And you're angry, and you should be, it's not fair (你很生气，你应该生气，因为这不公平)
[02:20.45] Just 'cause you can't see it, doesn't mean it, isn't there (仅仅因为你看不见，不代表它不存在)
[02:29.52]
[02:29.87] If they say (若他们说)
[02:31.89] Who cares if one more light goes out? (谁会在意，当光芒重现后再次消逝)
[02:35.50] In the sky of a million stars (在一片灿烂星河之中)
[02:40.49] It flickers, flickers (点点星光忽隐忽现，熠熠生辉)
[02:43.35] Who cares when someone's time runs out? (谁又会在意，当某人大限将至)
[02:46.92] If a moment is all we are (我们都仅是一瞬间)
[02:52.00] Or quicker, quicker (亦或是更快，更快)
[02:54.81] Who cares if one more light goes out? (谁还会在意那消逝的光芒)
[02:58.86] Well I do (然而，我会)
[03:18.24]I...
[03:28.39] Who cares if one more light goes out? (谁会在意，一道光芒熄灭掉)
[03:32.10] In the sky of a million stars (毕竟这满天星河数不尽)
[03:36.91] It flickers, flickers (它们不断闪烁着)
[03:39.76] Who cares when someone's time runs out? (一个人的时间终了，又有谁会在意)
[03:43.41] If a moment is all we are (毕竟我们转瞬即逝)
[03:48.31] Or quicker, quicker (或许更快，更快)
[03:51.24] Who cares if one more light goes out? (谁会在意，那道重现后再次消逝的光芒)
[03:55.20] Well I do (然而，我在意)
[04:03.00] Well I do (然而，我们在意)
